# An attribute refers to another attribute of the same object, via ξ.
#
#   ⟦ bar ↦ ⟦ Δ ⤍ 00-00-00-00-00-00-00-2A ⟧, foo ↦ ξ.bar ⟧
#
# The script below is printed by `phino sodg` 0.0.169.

F c0 bar foo
F c1
Δ c1 00-00-00-00-00-00-00-2A
P c0 bar c1
D c2 c0 bar
P c0 foo c2
